Exod 24:1 , Moses is called up into the mountain;
Exod 24:3 , The people promise obedience;
Exod 24:4 , Moses builds an altar, and twelve pillars;
Exod 24:6 , He sprinkles the blood of the covenant;
Exod 24:9 , The glory of God appears;
Exod 24:14 , Aaron and Hur have the charge of the people;
Exod 24:15 , Moses goes into the mountain, where he continues forty days and forty nights.
